{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测用户与源地址首次SonicWall远程登录。对应需求：初始访问。官方：First Seen SonicWall Remote Access Login by User and Source。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-sonicwall_firewall.log-*"],"interval":"5m","language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】用户与源地址首次SonicWall远程登录","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n用户与源地址首次SonicWall远程登录\n\n### 为何重要\n首次进入主机或服务\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/integrations/sonicwall_firewall","https://www.sonicwall.com/support/knowledge-base/monitoring-sslvpn-user-logins/kA1VN0000000JQz0AM","https://www.huntress.com/blog/sonicwall-credential-stuffing-campaign"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"7df97e5b-1722-4305-80c7-7a203f2ff36e","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 接入边界或主机网络日志（Packetbeat、防火墙、云流量等，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 初始访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 初始访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"data_stream.dataset:\"sonicwall_firewall.log\" and\n  event.action:\"login-success\" and\n  event.code:(\"235\" or \"236\" or \"237\" or \"238\" or \"1080\") and\n  source.ip:* and user.name:* and observer.serial_number:*\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","source.ip","destination.ip","destination.port","network.protocol","network.direction","tls.server.x509.subject.common_name","dns.question.name","host.name","user.name","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/"},{"id":"T1133","name":"External Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1133/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["observe